T: Blackberry Blossom (lute solo) [v.1 by Cranberry] (2:40)
N: "Blackberry Blossom", author unknown. Possibly Norman Blake (1977), but may be an older traditional bluegrass tune.
N: Song adapted to LotRO by Cranberry of Landroval, Mighty Mighty Bree Tones kinship.
M: 4/4
L: 1/8
Q:1/4=100
